{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "74cca7bc-df54-8ed6-9e64-26d64a305ee2",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T13:02:36-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:58:43-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:58:49-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I have a ticket. Parking ticket. It is not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:58:54-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry to hear that. Let me get some information from you. Can you tell me your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:01-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Joel Gomes. G-O-M-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:03-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Gomes. And do you have the ticket in front of you? There should be a ticket number near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:12-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. One moment. My daughter is here, she helps me with English. I read, she says if I am wrong. [pause] The number is four, four, seven, one, nine, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:23-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, four, seven, one, nine, two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:27-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:29-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, I have it here. This was issued for parking in a resident permit space without a permit displayed. What would you like to tell me about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:40-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I have the sticker. The resident sticker. It is on the windshield. Every day it is there. I am a homeowner here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:49-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Where on the windshield is the sticker placed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:53-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Left side, down. By the driver. Where they say to put."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:59:58-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be the proper place. Did the officer perhaps not see it, or could it have been obscured by anything, such as glare or rain on the glass?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:00:09-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It rained, yes. Friday into Saturday, the rain. But the sticker is inside the glass. Inside. Rain does not cover it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:00:17-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair, Mr. Gomes. Was the ticket written during that weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:00:22-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Saturday. In the morning. I go out and the paper is on the car. Three days I have this paper and I am angry, I tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:00:32-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can understand your frustration. The way to handle this is to file an appeal. You would submit the ticket number and a statement, and it helps to include a photograph of the sticker on your windshield."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:00:46-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photo. Okay. My daughter can do. She has the phone. How long does the appeal take? How long I wait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:00:54-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally it takes a few weeks for a review and a written decision to be mailed to you. Some are quicker, some take longer depending on how many are in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:01:06-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. And the money? I pay now or I wait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:01:11-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "While an appeal is pending, the ticket is normally held, but you should file promptly so that no late penalty is added. I'd recommend filing within the time period printed on the back of your ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:01:24-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Back of the ticket. [pause] She says yes, there is a paragraph. Fourteen days, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:01:31-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then you are well within the window if you file this week. You can bring the appeal to the Finance counter at City Hall, or mail it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:01:41-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I send by mail. It is easier. This is a bad day already. Friday I buy my lottery tickets, always, out of habit, and I win nothing. Now the city wants money from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:01:53-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that, Mr. Gomes. Let me make a note on the account that you called regarding this ticket and intend to appeal. Is the best number to reach you the one I see on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:06-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:08-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-one. That's correct. Should there be any question about your appeal, someone will call you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:16-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Photo, statement, ticket number, mail. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:20-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly right. Include a copy of your registration as well, so the sticker can be matched to your vehicle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:27-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Registration. Okay. Thank you, miss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:30-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Gomes. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:02:34-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
